# Toolshop QA Rules

- Run tests from `PrismStructure/` using npm scripts defined in `package.json` only.
- Never commit `.env` or bearer tokens; load credentials from environment variables.
- UI logic belongs in `pageObjects/`; API logic in `apiClients/`; specs stay thin.
- Tag every automated test `@smoke` or `@regression`; keep each tier within 5–8 tests.
- Map automated specs to AC1/AC2 in file headers or `project-info.md` traceability table.
- Prefer Playwright auto-waiting over fixed sleeps; probe live SUT before trusting AI locators.
- Document application quirks (e.g. checkout double Confirm) in page objects and comments.
